# Keep this repository LF-only.
#
# references/engineering-traps.md tells contributors that RSSHub rejects CRLF — so this
# repository should not ship CRLF itself. Without this file, a Windows clone with
# core.autocrlf=true checks files out as CRLF, which is what happened on first publication.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicit, in case anyone adds assets later.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
